{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04785","headline":"巴丘春作 · 张说","name":"巴丘春作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日出洞庭水，春山挂断霞。\n江涔相映发，卉木共纷华。\n湘戍南浮阔，荆关北望赊。\n湖阴窥魍魉，丘势辨巴蛇。\n岛户巢爲馆，渔人艇作家。\n自怜心问景，三岁客长沙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04785.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04785","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}